      <lines>
      <chord name="C"/>Rejoice, the <chord name="G/B"/>Lord <chord name="C"/>is <chord name="Am"/>King! <chord name="G"/>YourLord <chord name="Em"/>and <chord name="G7/D"/>King <chord name="C"/>adore!<br/>
