      <chord name="C"/>Rejoice in <chord name="G/B"/>glorious <chord name="Am"/>hope! <chord name="G"/>Our <chord name="F"/>Lord <chord name="Em"/>the <chord name="G7/D"/>judge <chord name="C"/>shall <chord name="G"/>come,<br/>
